$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Netarkath" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Overcast" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 2/4" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> After a bloody prison riot, the guards were forced to evacuate from this barren prison world.  Now the inmates have full control of the prison, but to no avail, they remain stranded on this remote world.  Two major factions exist in this prison, each headed by a respected Gang Leader.  In the past these two gangs put aside their differences and worked together to expel the prison guards.  Now, however, they have no common enemy to unite them.  Tensions have been running high, and violence was all but certain to erupt between the two gangs eventually.  Now as supplies dwindle it has become apparent that only enough remains for one of the two gangs!  Now is the time to act: kill or be killed! \n\nProtect your Gang Leader while attempting to kill your enemy's.  The first team to kill the enemy Gang Leader shall be declared the victor!";
